{"2692660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Car Mechanic Simulator 2026", "steam_appid": 2692660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/22913ddafdb63172805ea68169d648e7.poster.avif?t=1785340825\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/22913ddafdb63172805ea68169d648e7.webm?t=1785340825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/22913ddafdb63172805ea68169d648e7.mp4?t=1785340825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, repair, and grow your automotive empire — now with co-op gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Mechanic Simulator 2026 returns with new features while staying true to the series’ proven formula. This installment introduces the long-awaited co-op mode, allowing you to run your workshop together with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair cars and expand your collection, with over 500 available vehicle configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in any mode — gameplay is now fully customizable. Day and night cycle, deliveries, limited workspace, and job difficulty — everything can be tailored to match your preferred playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revised skill progression system offers even greater freedom, while the all-new garage customization mode lets you create a space exactly as you imagine it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op multiplayer mode </strong>– build and manage your garage together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro