ong>Advanced garage customization </strong>– decorate with tools, furniture, and lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic part deliveries </strong>– delivery time and cost depend on time of day and game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited availability of classic car parts </strong>– search the used parts market to find what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair jobs with time-based bonuses </strong>– complete tasks faster to earn higher rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal diagnostic station </strong>– check suspension and overall vehicle condition<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/8da7608c75292e2b4193a5b28a46e954.poster.avif?t=1785340825\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/8da7608c75292e2b4193a5b28a46e954.webm?t=1785340825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/8da7608c75292e2b4193a5b28a46e954.mp4?t=1785340825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New car discovery system </strong>– discovered vehicles can be viewed in the Carspedia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New vehicle selling system </strong>– instant sale or trade on the used car market</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junkyard </strong>– new vehicles available daily for dismantling and parts recovery<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692660/extras/ec92ae724b8973452a3a1652e94d8b99.poster.avif?t=1785340825\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse